        .top
          span.kind Breakthrough
          span.go →
        h4 CE & UKCA Certification
        p Independent testing and formal compliance marks on every board.
      = link_to breakthroughs_turnip_network_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Breakthrough
          span.go →
        h4 The Turnip Network
        p Board-to-board networking across your show.
      = link_to fun_stuff_release_notes_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Fun stuff
          span.go →
        h4 Release notes
        p What's new, what changed and what we quietly fixed.
      = link_to breakthroughs_path, class: 'next-card' do
        .top
          span.kind Index
          span.go →
        h4 All breakthroughs
        p Explore everything that makes Baldrick boards a bit special.

